# Source art - screenshots, exports, working files - which is kept here for
# convenience and is nobody's build input.
*.png

# Except the art the apps actually import. These are build inputs rather than
# source material: without them a fresh checkout cannot build the website, so
# they are tracked despite the rule above. Anything imported through
# `@vertix.gg/assets` belongs in this list.
!brand/user-avatar.png
!brand/vc-naked.png
!brand/vc-naked-header.png
